6>loose stools</36>, <37>constipation</37>, <38>occasional headaches</38>. Constitutional: Negative for <39>fever</39>, <40>chills</40>, <41>diaphoresis</41>, <42>appetite change</42>, +<43>fatigue</43> and <44>unexpected weight change</44>. HENT: Negative for <45>hearing loss</45>,
