acement</29>   <30>Echocardiogram</30>   Authorization for <31>TCHP</31> with <32>GCSF</32>            I spent a total of 60 minutes face-to-face with the patient and 45 minutes of that time was spent 
 counseling regarding the diagnosis and the treatment plan    
