od</30> is pretty good. She thinks <31>anxiety</31> is slightly improved. When she cannot sleep due to anxiety, she takes half tab of <32>Klonopin</32>. She does not take it every night. ***** was prescribed previously but she never took it. She has as local ***** that she saw a few weeks ago. 
