g as much as she used to. Patient Active Problem List Diagnosis Date Noted Malignant neoplasm of <43>left female breast</43> (CMS code) 04/05/2019 December 2018: Pt noticed a <44>left breast mass</44> ***** ***** Health 03/11/19: PCP Dr. ***** ***** palpated <45>2-3 cm mass in the left breast at 3:00</45>
