8. <41>RTC</41> with me in <42>September</42>. ***** ***** *****, <43>MD</43> <44>Medical Oncology/Hematology</44> TIME SPENT: I spent a total of <45>35 minutes</45> on this patient's care on the day of their visit excluding time spent related to any billed procedures.
