ity</35>. We discussed that she has baseline <36>joint pain</36> due to her <37>fibromyalgia</37>, so we will monitor this closely. She is already on <38>duloxetine</38> which has been shown to help, and is on <39>celebrex</39> as well. We recommend <40>NSAIDs</40> for <41>joint pain</41>.
