*****/*****/***** - *****/*****/***** completed 10 cycles of <1>capecitabine</1> <2>1000 mg</2> <3>qAM</3>, ***** ***** *****-14 of a <4>21 day cycle</4>    <5>12/07/17 PET CT</5> - <6>liver lesion</6> stable <7>2.1 cm</7> with <8>SUV 4</8>, <9>peri-portal node</9> improved (<10>1cm</10>, previously <11>1.4 cm</11>, and now no longer <12>hypermetabolic</12>). No new lesions    <13>02/08/18 PET CT</13> - stable, <14>2.1 cm liver lesion</14> (segment 7) is stable in size and now <15>non-hypermetabolic</15>. *****-portal node <16>1cm</16> (stable) and <17>non-hypermetabolic</17>    <18>04/09/18 PET/CT</18>: Interval increase in the size of and redevelopment of <19>hypermetabolism</19> in the previously described <20>liver</20> and <21>periportal lymph node metastases</21>. Interval development of <22>hypermetabolism</22> involving a <23>periapical lucency</23> in the <24>right maxilla</24>, likely related to <25>dental disease</25>. Recommend correlation with <26>dental examination</26>.    <27>04/21/18 to 12/07/18 C1D1 OPERA study</27> on <28>oral *****</28>   <29>04/27/18 ***** OPERA study</29> on <30>oral *****</30>  <31>05/06/18 ***** OPERA study</31> on <32>oral *****</32>  <33>05/18/18 ***** OPERA study</33> on <34>oral *****</34>  <35>06/14/18 PETCT</35> showed interval decrease in size of the <36>hepatic mass</36> and <37>portacaval lymph node</37> compared to prior scan.   <38>06/15/18 ***** OPERA study</38> on <39>oral *****</39>, <40>neupogen</40> *****-5, <41>November 24, 18-19</41>.  <42>06/25/18 2 units PRBC</42> without reactions.  <43>07/13/18 C4 OPERA</43> with <44>***** 300 mg BID</44> <45>D1, 8, 15 of 28 day cycle</45>  <46>08/09/18 PET CT</46> showed decreased size of <47>liver mass</47> and <48>periportal LN</48>, however increased <49>FDG avidity</49> when compared to <50>06/14/18</50>. ***** <51>hypodensities</51> along the <52>pancreatic neck/uncinate process</52> are unchanged likely reflecting <53>branch duct *****</53>.  <54>08/10/18 C5 OPERA</54> with <55>***** 300 mg BID</55> <56>D1, 8, 15</56>
``` 
