for subtle changes in disease state.    4. <37>Small left pleural effusion</37> with associated <38>compressive atelectasis</38> and/or <39>consolidation</39>.         PATHOLOGY:    11/07/19 <40>Right axillary LN core needle biopsy</40>  Collected: 11/07/2019          Case #: *****-2442       
