 <42>late July</42> and was seen by several <43>MDs</43>. She was prescribed an <44>anti-inflammatory patch</44> which did not help. She then saw her <45>cardiologist</45> who did not think it was <46>cardiac</46> in nature.     The patient that underwent a followup <47>PET/CT scan</47> performed at the ***** facility in *****, ***** on <48>August 20</48>,
